---
import ClientCaseStudyPage from "../../components/ClientCaseStudyPage.astro";
import CaseStudyImageSlot from "../../components/CaseStudyImageSlot.astro";
import { clientCaseStudyMedia } from "../../data/clientCaseStudyMedia";
const media = clientCaseStudyMedia.braces;
---
<ClientCaseStudyPage
  previewOnly={false}
  client="Balbriggan Braces"
  title="Balbriggan Braces: 28 Patient-Education Videos"
  metaTitle="Balbriggan Braces Dental Video Case Study | NextVision"
  description="A dental video production project in Balbriggan: twelve longer videos and sixteen short edits covering orthodontic and implant topics, organised by speaker and subject."
  intro="Twelve longer explanations and sixteen short edits, covering orthodontic and implant questions with three speakers."
  service="Patient-education video production"
  location="Balbriggan, County Dublin"
  hero={media.hero}
  serviceHref="/corporate-video-production-dublin/"
  serviceLabel="Explore business video production"
>
  <section id="the-project">
    <h2>Long explanations and focused short videos</h2>
    <p>The Balbriggan Braces project covered a range of patient questions. The longer videos keep each subject together; the short edits give individual questions their own space.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="the-topics">
    <h2>Three speakers, distinct subjects</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>James:</strong> five longer videos covering aligners, cleaning braces, wax and food, the orthodontic journey and retainers.</li>
      <li><strong>Jenny:</strong> three longer videos about an expander, a face mask and a twin block.</li>
      <li><strong>Rebecca:</strong> four longer videos covering dental implants, surgery, after-surgery information, and the implant crown and care.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The short collection focuses on narrower topics, including an aligner routine, orthodontic wax, retainer care, crossbite and implant parts. The clinical explanations come from the practice's speakers.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="client-image-pair">
    <CaseStudyImageSlot image={media.detail} assetKey="braces:detail" />
    <CaseStudyImageSlot image={media.work} assetKey="braces:work" />
  </div>

  <section id="the-edit">
    <h2>Making the explanations visible</h2>
    <p>The finished short videos combine the speakers with dental models, close-ups and on-screen graphics. In the aligner video, a timing graphic supports James's explanation. In the crossbite piece, a dental illustration sits alongside the demonstration.</p>
    <p>This is the connection between <a href="/corporate-video-production-dublin/">a longer business explanation</a> and <a href="/short-form-video-production-dublin/">a focused short edit</a>: the subject stays clear, while the amount of detail changes with the format.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="the-handover">
    <h2>A collection the practice can find its way around</h2>
    <p>The twelve longer videos were delivered in named speaker folders. The shorts were kept together with descriptive filenames. The upload was checked against the final files before handover in October 2026.</p>
    <p>For a similar project, start with the questions and the person best placed to explain each one. Our <a href="/blog/business-video-production-planning-dublin/">video planning guide</a> helps shape that list. This project also gives local businesses a concrete example of <a href="/videographer-balbriggan/">video production in Balbriggan</a>.</p>
  </section>
</ClientCaseStudyPage>
